{"user_request": "Please review the continuous-control row in the Q1 2028 board packet draft `doc_q1_2028_board_evidence` and post a readiness-review comment. Explain how the blank outcome-window field should be handled, identify the other metadata that must be present, and state whether the row can remain marked ready while any required input is incomplete.", "today": "2028-01-01", "tool": "post_doc_comment", "arguments": {"doc_id": "doc_q1_2028_board_evidence", "body": "Readiness review — CS auto-nudge continuous-control row: replace the blank outcome-window field with the exact value `not applicable — continuous control coverage`; do not invent a customer-outcome window. Coverage dates are present (October 1–December 31, 2027). The row still needs measurement limits, exclusions, source owner, source or release-reliability evidence, revenue and forecast treatment, and final claim owner. Keep the claim limited to system-control performance. It cannot remain marked ready while any required input is incomplete: with these fields blank, set readiness to `not board-ready` until they are completed."}, "checks": [{"check_id": "riley_172_02", "path": "args", "criterion": "The comment must state that this continuous-control row requires exact coverage dates and that its outcome-window field must be set exactly to `not applicable — continuous control coverage`, rather than being left blank or treated as a customer-outcome cohort window.

The comment must identify all remaining mandatory row metadata categories: measurement limits, exclusions, source owner, source or release-reliability evidence, revenue and forecast treatment, and final claim owner. Missing or materially substituting any category fails.

The comment must direct that the row be marked `not board-ready` and must not remain ready or tentatively ready until every required input is complete.", "value": {"doc_id": "doc_q1_2028_board_evidence", "body": "Readiness review — CS auto-nudge continuous-control row: replace the blank outcome-window field with the exact value `not applicable — continuous control coverage`; do not invent a customer-outcome window. Coverage dates are present (October 1–December 31, 2027). The row still needs measurement limits, exclusions, source owner, source or release-reliability evidence, revenue and forecast treatment, and final claim owner. Keep the claim limited to system-control performance. It cannot remain marked ready while any required input is incomplete: with these fields blank, set readiness to `not board-ready` until they are completed."}}]}
